# Repositories this scan should not fail on, one per line, with the reason.
#
# Ignored entries are still printed. A check that hides things is a check
# nobody reads, and the point of this file is only to stop a permanently red
# result from training everyone to skip the output.
#
# Do not add a repository here because fixing it is inconvenient. Add it when
# being stale is *correct* — the thing is retired, or it is deliberately pinned
# to an old envelope for a reason that is written down.

sqns   retired 2026-08-31 with the ns server; no longer deployed anywhere
